nt, known for taking down hard targets and protecting key company executives. She now serves as a\nguard\nfor\nRhodes Island\ncombat squad.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":50,"base":{"hp":1108,"atk":284,"def":135,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":2,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":1421,"atk":395,"def":193,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":2,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"1-1"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":1421,"atk":395,"def":193,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":20,"block":2,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":1822,"atk":535,"def":262,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":20,"block":2,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"1-1"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":80,"base":{"hp":1822,"atk":535,"def":262,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":22,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":2430,"atk":705,"def":320,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":22,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"1-1"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":0,"def":40}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests on this Operator show clear outlines of internal organs, with no abnormal dark spots or shadows. No unusual traces of Originium particles present in the circulatory system, no signs of infection, confirming this operator as uninfected. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0% \nNo Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.15u/L \nTake care when performing missions. \n\nSavage is in incredibly good health. If only everyone could be as healthy as her...\n--Medic Operator Hibiscus\n"},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Savage uses special Originium Arts in battle that detonate the ground struck by her hammer fractions of a second after impact. She has taken down difficult targets with these Arts.\nAfter a reverse-engineering study on her hammer, the engineering staff found her hammer was not armed with a blasting device at all, but rather, it acted as an unconventional staff. Savage uses the Originium housed inside the hammer to create the blasts.\nAlthough she doesn't fully understand the principles behind this power, when she is manipulating the hammer, she always unleashes tremendous explosive power. \nOther important information cannot be verified without further research."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Savage earned her codename thanks to the massive destruction she causes both in combat and on mining missions. The codename also matches her physique. \nHowever, despite her name, Savage is a fairly kind and cheerful Operator. She is known to be friendly, reliable, and fun both on and off the battlefield. \nTake not though, she is quite fierce when on the football field, so try not to yell at her while she's playing."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"Savage plays a very important role in combat. She clears obstacles to facilitate direct attacks against the enemy. She is also quite effective at protecting her teammates, and casualties are almost always lower than expected with her on a mission.\nSometimes she likes to get in the kitchen and make vegetable soups, mushroom pies, and other Rim Billitonian cuisine for her fellow Operators.\nMany Operators call her dishes comfort food.\nShe has been known to pitch in and help her teammates when she can, and she is increasingly well-liked.\nPlease do not post the names of suitors she has rejected on the bulletin board in the lounge. Thank you for your cooperation."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"[Classified Log] I have already spoken with Savage, and she understands our current situation. It is an issue between her and the Doctor. \nAt least Savage will fight for Amiya, and that is enough for now. \nI hope we have enough gumption to resolve this deadlock. \n--Kal'tsit"},{"section":"Promotion Record","unlock":"Unlocked at E2","description":"Savage made it clear she considers Amiya and Kal'tsit old-fashioned.\nSavage also stated her identity shouldn't matter to Rhodes Island. She believes as long as she is helping her friends, what and where her mission takes her is unimportant.\nShe will probably continue to fight as the only one who truly knows her limits."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Savage%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Savage%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Savage%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Savage%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"300 Metres Underground","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Savage%20-%20300%20Metres%20Underground.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Savage%20-%20300%20Metres%20Underground.webp"},{"label":"Secret Family Recipe","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Savage%20-%20Secret%20Family%20Recipe.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Savage%20-%20Secret%20Family%20Recipe.webp"},{"label":"Yet Another Autumn","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Savage%20-%20Yet%20Another%20Autumn.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Savage%20-%20Yet%20Another%20Autumn.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Rhodes Island","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Closure","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Closure%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"Minimum DP -4 ( -1 ) when Closure is in the squad; all [Rhodes Island] Operators ATK +4%.","matchedKeyword":"Rhodes Island"}]},{"operatorName":"Kal'tsit - Esperanta","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Kal'tsit%20-%20Esperanta%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When other allies enter this unit's Attack Range, they will immediately gain 1 Shield and be granted a buff, healing by 60 ( +10 ) HP per secon